In this project, I implemented class methods using C++ object-oriented programming concepts.
* Created a Student class with data members such as roll number and name.
* Defined a member function to display student information.
* Created an object of the Student class.
* Assigned values to the object's attributes.
* Accessed class members using the object.
* Called class methods to display the stored data.
* Explored different ways of defining class member functions.
* Practiced basic object-oriented programming principles.
This project helped me understand classes, objects, member functions, data members, and the fundamentals of object-oriented programming in C++.
